}}The '''Cursed Ship''' (or '''Haunted Ship''') is a [[Locations|location]] found near [[Graveyard Island]]. Onboard, there is a black door that requires the player to be at least Level 1000 to enter. However, the player is able to use [[Portal]]'s {{Ability|Portal|C}} to enter it at any level (as long as they are in the [[Second Sea]]). It primarily serves as the grinding area for players between [[levels]] 1250-1350.

== Navigation ==
As the player enters, they will see a room to both sides, and an entrance towards a staircase. Both rooms, left and right, are the exact same having a group of [[Ship Deckhand|Ship Deckhands]], with the left side connecting to an area with multiple rooms (one of them being occupied by [[El Admin]]), and the right connecting to [[El Perro|El Perro's]] room. 

Both initial rooms also contain a pathway, leading down to the engine room. [[El Rodolfo]] can be found here, alongside the [[Ship Engineer|Ship Engineers]]. 

Coming backwards, to the room with the staircase and the [[Front Crew Quest Giver]], the player will look up to find a glass dome, with the backside of the staircase leading to the galley, occupied by [[Ship Steward|Ship Stewards]] and the [[Experimic]].

Upstairs, the player will immediately be met by [[Guashiem]], with two large rooms on both sides, housing multiple [[Ship Officer|Ship Officers]], with the giant room in the middle being the chambers of the [[Cursed Captain]].

